  "title": "T.G.I. Friday's Jack Daniels Sauce",
  "description": "This Jack Daniels BBQ sauce recipe is an easy, from-scratch copycat of T.G.I. Friday's famous whiskey sauce for salmon, ribs, chicken, and pork chops.",
  "authors": [
    "Michael DeLong"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:13:17-05:00",
